{
  "id": "LEV.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "LEV",
  "reference": "Leviticus 1",
  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " called to Moses from the Tent of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s presence and gave him the following rules ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for the Israelites to observe when they offer their sacrifices.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When anyone offers an animal sacrifice, it may be one of his cattle or one of his sheep or goats. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If he is offering one of his cattle as a burnt offering, he must bring a bull without any defects. He must present it at the entrance of the Tent of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s presence so that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will accept him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The man shall put his hand on its head, and it will be accepted as a sacrifice to take away his sins. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall kill the bull there, and the Aaronite priests shall present the blood to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and then throw it against all four sides of the altar which is at the entrance of the Tent. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he shall skin the animal and cut it up, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the priests shall arrange firewood on the altar and light it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall put on the fire the pieces of the animal, including the head and the fat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The man must wash the internal organs and the hind legs, and the officiating priest will burn the whole sacrifice on the altar. The smell of this food offering is pleasing to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the man is offering one of his sheep or goats, it must be a male without any defects. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall kill it on the north side of the altar, and the priests shall throw its blood on all four sides of the altar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After the man cuts it up, the officiating priest shall put on the fire all the parts, including the head and the fat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The man must wash the internal organs and the hind legs, and the priest will present the sacrifice to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and burn all of it on the altar. The smell of this food offering is pleasing to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the man is offering a bird as a burnt offering, it must be a dove or a pigeon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The priest shall present it at the altar, wring its neck, and burn its head on the altar. Its blood shall be drained out against the side of the altar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall remove the crop and its contents and throw them away on the east side of the altar where the ashes are put. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall take hold of its wings and tear its body open, without tearing the wings off, and then burn it whole on the altar. The smell of this food offering is pleasing to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "LEV.2",
    "number": "2",
